  "LongDescription": "Radhuni Panch Phoran is a traditional Bengali five-spice mix, specially crafted to add a burst of flavor and aroma to dishes. This blend of whole spices is perfect for tempering and is widely used in Bengali and South Asian cuisine.rnrnIngredients: Fennel Seeds, Cumin Seeds, Nigella Seeds (Kalonji), Fenugreek Seeds, Mustard Seeds.rnrnUses:rnTempering: Add to hot oil to release flavors and infuse curries, dals, and stir-fries.rnBengali Cuisine: Essential for preparing traditional dishes like shukto, charchari, and dal.rnPickles: Widely used in preparing homemade pickles.rnVegetables: Ideal for stir-frying vegetables, adding a unique, aromatic twist.rnSoups and Stews: Enhances the flavor and aroma when used in broths and stews.",
